Z||000050||Voytek||09-04-2001||02:58 PM||||I was one of the few people that agreed with Cheever a few weeks ago.  I'm not sure what political correctness has to do with anything here.  If you mean 'look at and post whatever photos you want', then you might be contradicting yourself.  If I'm not mistaken, Cheever complained about the crap posted on PFF.<P>Political correctness has nothing to do with what's posted in this thread (and no, I'm not offended by this photo - I find it quite comical, including the comparison to Fierochic88).  Political correctness would be:<BR>- not calling indians Indians, but native Americans<BR>- not being able to say that women are weaker than men (generally) because it might offend someone<BR>- modifying the national anthem to throw out the word God (because it might offend some religion)<P>Etc, etc, etc.  Notice: in the wake of the political correctness crap, pornography and generally offensive materials have not been labeled 'politically incorrect'.  If anything, the amount of crap has only increased in the last 20 years.<P>Do I agree with PC?  I hate it.  No flaming intended, but I think you've got your definition a bit mixed up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000051||Urchin||09-04-2001||03:39 PM||||Argh!!  Not again!  Is this ever going to end?  I think we all need to lighten up a bit.  We have too many people who get off on argueing with one another.  I will admit that I enjoy the odd debate, when it is done in a civil manner.  I personally don't care who gets along with who, or who disagrees with what (to an extent).  But I have noticed that we have an abundance of members that are considering leaving, have left, or just don't visit as often due to the childish behaviour that is so often displayed here.  Cliff recently gave us the "private message" option.  I am curious to know how many of us actually use it.  Many comments/insults made recently could/should have been done through private messages.  The reason why they haven't is probably due to the fact that people want others to see their "clever" remarks and join their side.  ...sad.  At first I used to think people were exhagerating a tad when it came to their complaints on the consistency of these incidents.  Now, I'm beginning to see that they are right.  It is happenning more and more.  It may be only a matter of time before we lose the privilage of coming here.  In a sense, that has already happened for some (those who have chosen to leave for this reason).  Songman for instance.  Hopefully he reconsiders, but I don't blame him if he doesn't.  Hopefully things will improve a little...  but all I can say is that if you have a problem with someone, rather than making it a public spectical, take it to private message.  Hopefully we can avoid more of us leaving due to the immature behaviour.   Just my thoughts, sorry it's a little long.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
